Third-party code incorporated into this repository
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. See-through: Single-image Layer Decomposition for Anime Characters
   https://github.com/shitagaki-lab/see-through   (Apache-2.0)
   Authors: Jian Lin, Chengze Li, Haoyun Qin, Kwun Wang Chan, Yanghua Jin,
            Hanyuan Liu, Stephen Chun Wang Choy, Xueting Liu
   Paper:   arXiv:2602.03749, ACM SIGGRAPH 2026 Conference Papers
            doi:10.1145/3799902.3811209
   Files under src/img2live/engine/ are derived from this project (the
   LayerDiff3D UNet / transparent VAE / k-diffusion SDXL pipeline and the
   body/head two-pass inference procedure). They were modified: imports were
   flattened into this package, utility functions were extracted, the
   inference procedure was re-implemented as a library API, and the head pass
   keeps its native high-resolution output. Each derived file carries a
   header stating its origin and that it was modified.

2. LayerDiffuse (Lvmin Zhang et al.)   https://github.com/lllyasviel/LayerDiffuse
   Code: Apache-2.0. The transparent-VAE design used by the engine follows this work.

3. Marigold (Marigold Team, ETH Zurich)  https://github.com/prs-eth/Marigold
   Apache-2.0. NOT included in the default pipeline (the optional depth stage
   is disabled; see docs).

